# --- case studies: LOCAL ONLY ---
# Nothing here goes public until Alex says a finding is worth publishing. A case
# study is a scientific claim, not a code change: "the package is ready to ship"
# is not the same decision as "this result should be read by strangers", and they
# were conflated once already. Ignored wholesale so the second decision has to be
# made deliberately -- by un-ignoring -- rather than by a stray `git add`.
case_studies/

